Thank you for your email. Currently, N-trig will not be releasing any

code to Linux Open Source.

 

We are aware of the driver developed autonomously by Rafi Rubin,

ostensibly for DuoSense. We have found this driver to be incompatible

with our product.

 

We are involved in developing applicable code for our DuoSense product,

and will notify Linux Open Source in the future. as soon as it is mature
enough to be released.

